92186295648 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295653 13194139534563 true] [17592186295648 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534563 true] [17592186295648 1041 "selection" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295648 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295653 13194139534563 true] [17592186295648 1110 #uuid "3a736c53-127e-5c29-a3cb-31729a82f496" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295649 1034 "-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295649 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295649 1111 #uuid "49bb5a2f-4855-5f1e-9bc6-ff3ad87887e4" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295650 1034 "-2\\pi " 13194139534563 true] [17592186295650 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295650 1111 #uuid "c7e5d511-7fb4-55b8-b12d-74caedaebb60" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295651 1034 "-\\frac{5\\pi }{2}" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295651 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295651 1111 #uuid "4cac7b5a-4994-57aa-a769-e16c81994a99" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295652 1034 "-\\pi " 13194139534563 true] [17592186295652 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295652 1111 #uuid "59e5f508-e91d-5a55-b9f5-58de45027098" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295653 1034 "0" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295653 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295653 1111 #uuid "ee3143ce-d9c3-586f-b1bb-96a91734bd3b" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295654 1017 #edb/ref 17592186295655 13194139534563 true] [17592186295654 1089 "q-51143" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295654 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534563 true] [17592186295654 1100 "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}+31}{(x-2)^{2}(2x+1)}=\\frac{A}{x-2}+\\frac{B}{(x-2)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{2x+1},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, and $C$ are real constants, determine the value of $A\\cdot B\\cdot C.$" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295654 1113 #uuid "83d87495-9a05-50e5-8fdd-f9cab6c7f065" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295654 1145 "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x-2)^{2}(2x+1)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+31 & =A(x-2)(2x+1)+B(2x+1)+C(x-2)^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-\\frac{1}{2}$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}+31 & =A(-\\frac{1}{2}-2)(2[-\\frac{1}{2}]+1)+B(2[-\\frac{1}{2}]+1)+C{(-\\frac{1}{2}-2)}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}+31 & =A(-\\frac{5}{2})(-1+1)+B(-1+1)+C(\\frac{25}{4}) \\\\ \\frac{125}{4} & =\\frac{25C}{4} \\\\ C & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=2$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{2}+31 & =A(2-2)(2\\cdot 2+1)+B(2\\cdot 2+1)+C(2-2)^{2} \\\\ 35 & =5B \\\\ B & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, letting $x=0$ and using our values for $B$ and $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}+31 & =A(0-2)(2\\cdot 0+1)+7(2\\cdot 0+1)+5(0-2)^{2} \\\\ 31 & =-2A+7+20 \\\\ 31 & =-2A+27 \\\\ 2A & =-4 \\\\ A & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nHence,\n\n$$\nA\\cdot B\\cdot C=(-2)\\cdot 7\\cdot 5=-70.\n$$" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295656 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295657 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295658 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295659 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295660 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1041 "selection" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295660 13194139534563 true] [17592186295655 1110 #uuid "88d8e430-d5a3-572a-9807-7705d10cd994" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295656 1034 "64" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295656 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295656 1111 #uuid "10824ecc-6409-5de5-a34c-fc83b34d2292" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295657 1034 "-42" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295657 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [17592186295657 1111 #uuid "e1a53c54-5066-5ff8-8a99-c359bc0d171f" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295658 1034 "50" 13194139534563 true] [17592186295658 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534563 true] [175921862956